# Read-only Sanity token so the frontend can read the published catalog.
# Create a "Viewer" token at https://www.sanity.io/manage -> project -> API -> Tokens.
# Vite inlines VITE_* vars into the client bundle at build time.
#   - Local dev: copy this to .env.local and fill the value.
#   - Production: also set VITE_SANITY_READ_TOKEN in the Vercel project env vars.
VITE_SANITY_READ_TOKEN=
